  "title": "Project Hail Marry",
  "date": "2026-07-04T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Project Hail Marry\n\nMy brain seems refuse to do some thinking today. So I decide to watch some movie as a rest, Project Hail Mary.\n\nPoster\n\nThe story is about a high school teacher being forced to go outer space to find solution to solve the molecules that is \"eating\" the sun.\n\nDuring his journey, he lost his crews. But he met another alien \"Rocky\" who is also looking for the solution. Eventually they find the predators that can ballance the molecules. But the teacher can only stay at Rocky's home planet due to the shortness of fuel.\n\nGuess the life is too hard so we make heroes in story to make us move forward.",
